        "text": "Guess what?\n\nWe are nearing 50 app submissions (currently 47!) at @Netlify Hot AR Summer \n\nSo many wonderful ideas.. check out the showcase 👇🏼\n\nhttps://hot-ar-summer.netlify.app/showcase",
