        "id": "2074805690258899066",
        "text": "Testing @AIatMeta’s new Muse Image and I’m genuinely impressed.💜\n\nMake sure turn on the Thinking Mode to get the best result. \nI start with an elegant older Japanese lady and pushed it hard with precise editing. \nThe skin texture and realism are excellent. 🔥\n\nWhat stood out most:\n1. Extremely precise editing while keeping the original person 100% consistent (face, wrinkles, skin details)\n2. Strong instruction following\n3. Agentic reasoning\n\nStill early days, but Muse Image feels like a solid step forward for practical use — fashion, editorial, film, product viz, and photo editing.\n\nWhat do you think, have you tried it yet?",
